Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: multi-account switcher and usage assistant for Claude Code
 CCS keeps several Claude Code accounts on one machine and switches between
 them with a single command, without logging out and in again.
 .
 It also watches the usage of every account (5-hour session and weekly
 limits), forecasts when a session will run out, recommends the best account,
 switches automatically before a limit is reached (running sessions follow
 on their next request), orchestrates the 5-hour windows of all accounts
 (chained and staggered during active hours, expiring quota used first),
 sends desktop notifications, analyses local Claude Code
 logs per project, model and hour, and can start a 5-hour window early.
 .
 Includes the `ccs` command, the "Comptes Claude" GTK application, a top bar
 indicator and a systemd user service.
